<section class="h-sec wrap h-problem" aria-labelledby="h-problem-title">
  <h2 id="h-problem-title">Plans made in chat scroll away.</h2>
  <p class="h-intro">Who's booking the scrim? When's the VOD review? It was settled in the channel an hour ago, and now it's forty messages up. So someone opens another app, and half the team never does. Every update means leaving Discord, and keeping two places in sync turns into a job of its own.</p>
  <p class="h-why">We built TTM because we lived it. That's why there's no dashboard to visit and no account to create: everything happens in Discord, with the buttons and menus your team already knows.</p>
</section>
